        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Bands: The Limousines, Faith No More\n- Albums: Get Sharp\n- Record Labels: Koolarrow Records\n- People: Billy Gould\n- Places: San Francisco, San Francisco Bay Area, California\n- Genres: Indietronica, Rock, Electropop\n\nFacts:\n- Faith No More is an American rock band from San Francisco, California, and it was formed in 1979.\n- The Limousines are an American indietronica band based in California's San Francisco Bay Area.\n- Get Sharp is the debut album by the electropop group The Limousines.\n- Koolarrow Records is an independent record label based in San Francisco, and Faith No More bassist Billy Gould set it up.",
